   275	### 3.4 The main irreducible theorem
   276	
   277	> **Theorem 3.5.** Let `F` be a noninvertible Keller map of geometric degree
   278	> `N >= 3` with `A_F` **irreducible**, `a := a_{A_F}`. Then neither of the
